From 2f313e851f5ee96695882b10db187bd78c3685c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: STX Hardening <noreply@example.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 00:47:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Billing lifecycle: renewals, reminders, suspension,
 unsuspension

- paid_until on each server order (migration 016 backfills existing servers to >= 7 days out)
- Renewal orders reuse the pay / upload slip / staff approve flow
- hosting:run-billing (hourly): invoice 7d ahead, remind at 3d and 1d, suspend after grace;
  never deletes; no suspension while a slip awaits review; 24h minimum notice
- ApplyRenewalJob: idempotent date extension and unsuspend; early payment keeps remaining days
- BillingNotice mail notification; order page shows paid-until, renew button, suspended state
- Order approve/retry route to the right job; renewals excluded from open-order cap
